    "chunk_text": "i\u00feost \u00fea \u00fee Seo \u00fee bi\u00f0 w\u00e6terigre gecyndo sio h\u00e6f\u00f0 gode girnesse metes, hio n\u00e6f\u00f0 gode meltunge swi\u00feost on Be cealdre & w\u00e6tre gecyndo wambe, sio wamb sio \u00f0e bi\u00f0 cealdre o\u00f0\u00f0e w\u00e6tre gecyndo o\u00f0\u00f0e Gif hio \u00feonne bi\u00fe innor on \u00feam fl\u00e6scehtum stowum mid syndrigum stowum & w\u00e6tingum & Selest l\u00e6cedom is to swilcum \u00feingum \u00fe\u00e6t mon gelome nyttige \u00feices & \u00fea wambe mid \u00fey geslea Ba\u00feige hine gelome on d\u00e6ge & hwilum mid ele smire. Him hylp\u00f0 eac \u00fe\u00e6t him f\u00e6t cild \u00e6t slape & \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00fe\u00e6t gedo neah his wambe simle. Him hylp\u00f0 eac ofen bacen hlaf & scellehte fiscas on wose & \u00feone mete \u00fee wel myltan wille. Be hatre & drigre wambe, gif sio wamb adlig bi\u00f0 hat hw\u00e6thwega eac \u00fe\u00e6re drignesse, \u00feonne ne Gif sio yfle w\u00e6te to micel sie \u00feonne dugon him ceald w\u00e6ter & scearpe mettas butan h\u00e6tu. Hwilum beo\u00fe \u00fea w\u00e6tan on \u00fe\u00e6re wambe filmenum, \u00feonne sceal men \u00fe\u00e6t wislice secean & w\u00e6rlice Be h\u00e6med\u00feingum, eallum \u00feyrrum lichomum h\u00e6med\u00feing ne dugon ac swi\u00feost \u00feyrrum & cealdum, Swelcum mannum deah \u00fe\u00e6t hie him geswinc angesecen & hie selfe drencen butan ba\u00f0e & mid Be cealdre gecyndo wambe, se \u00fee cealdre gecyndo sie nyttige se gemetlices yfel",
